A few news for the starting year:

o The arm-nommu support for 2.4.22 (uClinux base) initially developed
with GDB/Armulator has recently been successfully validated on actual
hardware too (AT91).

o A preliminary port to ia64 (Itanium 2) is available.

Since savannah.gnu.org does not give access to the download area yet,
this work can be reached via the CVS only.

